cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pycdloop in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "pycdloop: arithmetic in Cayley-Dickson loops and their loop algebras"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for Cayley-Dickson loops, their central products, and the
  loop algebras of both over the real numbers, the complex numbers, and
  finite fields, with quasilinear multiplication built on the
  Cayley-Dickson arithmetic of fastCD: O(N log N) operations in the loop
  algebra of a Cayley-Dickson loop of order 2N.
authors:
  - family-names: Lemley
    given-names: Harrison
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://git.tanuki-cd.com/algebraity/pycdloop"
keywords:
  - Cayley-Dickson loops
  - loop algebras
  - central products
  - nonassociative algebras
  - Walsh-Hadamard transform
  - finite fields
  - fast multiplication
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Quasilinear multiplication in Cayley-Dickson loop algebras"
  authors:
